Changed the NIST CVE Search Job to set a CVE's CVSS base score and severity from the highest CVSS version in the CVE's NIST data, including CVSS v4.0. CVSS v2 severity is always derived from the base score.
Changed the NIST CVE Search Job to leave the `cvss_v2` and `cvss_v3` fields empty when NIST does not provide an exploitability score, instead of defaulting them to 10.
Changed the NIST CVE Search Job to log a warning and leave the CVSS base score empty when NIST provides a CVSS metric without a base score.
